MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Guj_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Guj_m01_001: Hey, kids. Got something you need to discuss with\nol' Guzran?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Guj_m01: <BLN>Need something from me?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m01_001: I suppose the thing to do in this kind of situation is to\nhire fighters to join us, huh?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m01_002: But...can we really trust the kind of adults who'd\nwant to fight with us? We're just kids.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m01_003: You're right. Lots of people could try to scam us.\nThat's why we have to use our good judgment. 
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m01: <BLN>I want us to have more allies...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_001: So in the Heroic Games, not only do we have to deal\nwith that scary queen and her mean-looking crew...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_002: we also have to go up against the strongest fighters\nin Dagda? Are...are we really going to be OK?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_003: We have to be, if we want to save Cai's dad.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_004: Argh... If I could go train somewhere a little, I might\nfeel a bit less like a walking target...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_005: I'm almost certain I read about a training area\nsomewhere in the arena.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_006: Do you think they'll let a bunch of kids use it?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_007: Oh yeah, hmmm... We should talk to Centurio.\nI imagine he can get us permission.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02_008: Yeah, we'll try talking to him later.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Tia_Pet_m02: <BLN>We're just kids...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01_001: Cai, I trust you're well. I hope you're getting used to\nlife in Dagsion.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01_002: You'd like to use the training grounds? I'm sorry, but\nthat won't be possible.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01_003: At the present time, access to it is limited to those\nparticipating in the Heroic Games.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01_004: I understand your desire to get into the training\ngrounds, but I cannot bend the rules for anyone.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Cen_m01: <BLN>How are you?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Gab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Gab_m01_001: Hey! This isn't a playground! How'd you kids even\nget in here, anyway?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Gab_m01_002: Everything up ahead's off limits to you. Get out!\nNo hanging around!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Gab_m01: <BLN>No entry!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_m01_001: You guys want to use the training grounds inside\nthe arena?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_m01_002: Sorry, but we have to give participants in the Heroic\nGames top priority for that space.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_m01_003: Regular members of the public can't use it.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m01_001: The exam for additional participants is at noon on\n{SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}. Be sure you don't forget!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m01: <BLN>The date of the exam is...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m02_001: The participant exam is today at noon! When you're\nready, give me a shout.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Hur_Arena_m02: <BLN>Don't forget! The exam's today!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_001: That was so nice. It's been such a long time since I\nwas able to talk with Castor.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_002: Even more than that, I'm glad that you've grown up\nso splendidly, Cai!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_003: Speaking of which, has Castor been taken back to\nhis cell already?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_004: It must be so hard for you, Cai. Please understand.\nNone of this is your fault.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_005: I've hoped to plead for Castor's life.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_006: I thought if I could speak with Father just once...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_007: ...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01_008: Forgive me. I'm just... I'm scared.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_Aur_m01: <BLN>It's been so long...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B01_m01_001: What's all the fuss about? Lotta folks gathering\nover on the west side of town, at Alcineus Gate.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B01_m01: <BLN>Something's happening...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B02_m01_001: C'mon! You gotta hurry if you want a good spot!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B02_m01: <BLN>Hurry! Hurry!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B03_m01_001: I hear the queen of Saramis is a real beauty. I've got\nto get eyes on her right away!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B03_m01: <BLN>Rumor is...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B04_m01_001: It's been noisy around here all morning. Is it time?\nIs the queen of Saramis's procession happening?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B04_m01_002: Enough standing around! I've got to get over there!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B04_m01: <BLN>What's going on?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B05_m01_001: Aren't you that kid who I saw the queen punch?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B05_m01_002: So awful. I bet she thinks she can get away with\nanything because she's royalty.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B05_m01: <BLN>Aren't you that kid?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B07_m01_001: I heard the queen of Saramis can punch through\nrock with that right hook of hers.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B07_m01_002: So how come you caught one and came out OK?\nEither the queen was pulling her punches, or...
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B07_m01: <BLN>Unbelievable...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B08_m01_001: Do you know a mercenary named Guzran? What a\nbraggart! I can hardly believe a word he says.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B08_m01_002: He's got stories about slaying dragons, riding clouds...\nI haven't the foggiest if any of his stories are true.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c03_B08_m01_003: Still, he's really sweet. Not that you'd get that from\nlooking at him. And the local kids all love him.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c03_B08_m01: <BLN>I can hardly believe a word...